Let's do the desk practice at 13:10 on Monday, 28 October, and try the handof=
f on duty for Session 8 on Tuesday, 29 October. I've attached the one-page re=
ference for the duty desk and the slides we'll use on Monday.

We'll swap roles after the first question. I want us to practise the moment w=
e can see a complete exercise won't reach the learner by the end of the next =
day. Tell Arjun what's still needed and when it's due, then have him give bac=
